{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18834","headline":"海阳十咏 棼丝瀑 · 刘禹锡","name":"海阳十咏 棼丝瀑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞流透嵌隙，喷洒如丝棼。\n含晕迎初旭，翻光破夕曛。\n余波遶石去，碎响隔溪闻。\n却望琼沙际，逶迤见脉分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}